a0a&_nc_ohc=PkhmkLIJZt0Q7kNvwHY4xSh&_nc_oc=AdoUe1KcV356_b_ZI3CkUCjqJ-1FNFRLgDN87iYThf_Qjey1mRZIQ76-mhQbO8-3zug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHsZ5h_8apN2rDmglZA5WslgEUG_DM0wf8e7I8aeId_Uw&oe=6A8448D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_001_0000.png", "id": "1084731707448113", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828608_1084731714114779_618887504652387920_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y7ncsOFkcxIQ7kNvwEbn0sQ&_nc_oc=AdoA0lLa1ZPgPNCi5HT6yGvv63a6dkwZ_DhY0o_tt2i415RXTzEgxgRLIuUo_9R1XeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEMY6XDU0-lGvEEGZKy1RxHxzB3gP5NIwuwmlOoq5k4Iw&oe=6A844B4D"}, "display_name": "StashXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Browse, search, and stream your Stash library right from your headset. StashXR connects to your self-hosted Stash server and puts your entire media collection at your fingertips in a sleek, immersive interface.\n\nFilter by tags, performers, studios. Sort however you like. \nFind exactly what you're looking for in seconds.\nWatch your media in flat-screen mode or fully immersive VR/XR.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Full search, filter, and sort across your Stash library\n- Infinity Wall - Browse endlessly through your collection\n- Hand Tracking support allowing for seamless controls\n- Flat-screen and immersive VR/XR playback modes\n- Connects to your self-hosted Stash server over your local network\n- Clean, fast interface designed for headset navigation\n- Transcoding support for easy playback\n- Private - your library stays on your server", "short_description": "Browse, search, and stream your Stash library from your headset. \n\n- Filter by tags, performers, studios\n- Watch in flat-screen or fully immersive VR/XR mode. \n- Connects to your self-hosted Stash server.\n\nYour collection, your headset, fully private."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://